comments.body:
A user with tools.manage_plugins can create bindings for any team, even teams they don't belong to.

Consider adding team membership validation, like so:

```python
user_teams = current_user_ctx.get("teams", [])
is_admin = current_user_ctx.get("is_admin", False)

if not is_admin:
    for team_id in request.teams.keys():
        if team_id not in user_teams:
            raise HTTPException(403, f"Not authorized for team {team_id}")
```
